{"id":"u108","kelas":"kosa","no":9,"judul":"Pekerjaan dan Tempat Kerja","title":"Jobs and Workplaces","emoji":"🧑‍🔧","ringkas":"Nama pekerjaan, tugas, dan tempat kerja","ready":true,"goals":["mempelajari **nama pekerjaan** dan **tempat kerja**","menjelaskan **tugas pekerjaan** dengan kata kerja yang tepat","mengenali kata melalui **arti, ejaan, dan pendengaran**","memakai pola *What does she do?* dan *He works as a ... in a ...*"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Menyebut pekerjaan dan tempat kerja adalah topik percakapan yang sangat umum. Pelajari kata berikut serta pola **What do you do?** dan **I work as a ... at ...**"},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Pekerjaan","items":[{"en":"farmer","id":"petani","ex":"The farmer grows rice."},{"en":"nurse","id":"perawat","ex":"The nurse works at a hospital."},{"en":"driver","id":"pengemudi","ex":"The driver is polite."},{"en":"cook","id":"juru masak","ex":"The cook makes soup."},{"en":"mechanic","id":"montir","ex":"The mechanic repairs cars."},{"en":"engineer","id":"insinyur","ex":"The engineer designs bridges."},{"en":"accountant","id":"akuntan","ex":"The accountant checks the numbers."},{"en":"waiter","id":"pelayan","ex":"The waiter brings the menu."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Tempat kerja","items":[{"en":"office","id":"kantor","ex":"She works in an office."},{"en":"factory","id":"pabrik","ex":"He works in a factory."},{"en":"hospital","id":"rumah sakit","ex":"The hospital is near my house."},{"en":"restaurant","id":"restoran","ex":"They eat at a restaurant."},{"en":"shop","id":"toko","ex":"She works in a shop."},{"en":"farm","id":"lahan pertanian","ex":"My uncle lives on a farm."},{"en":"workshop","id":"bengkel","ex":"The workshop is on this street."},{"en":"school","id":"sekolah","ex":"My mother works at a school."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Tugas dan kegiatan kerja","items":[{"en":"repair","id":"memperbaiki","ex":"He can repair motorbikes."},{"en":"serve","id":"melayani","ex":"She serves the customers."},{"en":"deliver","id":"mengantar","ex":"They deliver food by motorbike."},{"en":"manage","id":"mengelola","ex":"She manages the shop."},{"en":"design","id":"merancang","ex":"He designs houses."},{"en":"sell","id":"menjual","ex":"They sell fresh fish."},{"en":"teach","id":"mengajar","ex":"She teaches English."},{"en":"build","id":"membangun","ex":"They build roads."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Apa pekerjaanmu?","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"What do you do, Budi?","id":"Apa pekerjaanmu, Budi?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"I am a mechanic. I work in a workshop.","id":"Aku montir. Aku bekerja di bengkel."},{"who":"Tom","en":"What do you do there?","id":"Apa yang kamu lakukan di sana?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"I repair motorbikes and cars.","id":"Aku memperbaiki sepeda motor dan mobil."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Do you like your job?","id":"Apakah kamu suka pekerjaanmu?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"Yes, I love it!","id":"Ya, aku menyukainya!"}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Setiap kali bertemu seseorang bekerja (kasir, sopir, guru), sebutkan dalam hati: *She is a cashier. She works in a shop.* Latihan sederhana ini memperkuat pola kalimat."},{"t":"summary","items":["Pekerjaan: [[farmer]], [[nurse]], [[driver]], [[cook]], [[mechanic]], [[engineer]].","Tempat kerja: [[office]], [[factory]], [[hospital]], [[restaurant]], [[shop]], [[farm]].","Tugas dan kegiatan kerja: [[repair]], [[serve]], [[deliver]], [[manage]], [[design]], [[sell]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"farmer\"?","options":["petani","insinyur","membangun","juru masak"],"answer":0,"exp":"farmer = petani.","k":"696330e7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"petani\" adalah...","options":["farmer","teach","farm","factory"],"answer":0,"exp":"petani = farmer.","k":"46e32260"},{"type":"fill","id":"Isi dengan kata Inggris untuk \"petani\":","q":"The ___ grows rice.","answers":["farmer","farmer"],"hint":"f _ _ _ _ _","exp":"petani = farmer.","k":"da5ad6ca"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"nurse\"?","options":["perawat","lahan per